---
const tech = [
  'C++ · C# · Python · Lua',
  'Unreal · Unity · Godot',
  'OpenGL · Vulkan · PS4/PS5',
  'UDP/TCP · Steam API · LAN',
  'Git · Linux · Android',
  'CI/CD · profiling · tooling',
];
---

<section id="about" class="scene" data-oct-state="about">
  <div class="scene__stage">
    <div class="oct-anchor ab__anchor" data-oct-anchor="about" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="stage__head">
      <div class="meta">
        <p class="label label--signal">L3 &middot; About</p>
        <p class="label">Auckland, NZ &middot; NZ citizen &middot; <span class="hatch">////////</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="counter" aria-hidden="true"><span class="n">05</span><span class="d">/ 06</span></div>
    </div>
    <ul class="stage__ticks" aria-hidden="true"><li></li><li></li></ul>
  </div>

  <div class="step" data-step="0">
    <div class="ab__text">
      <h2>The layer underneath</h2>
      <p>
        I’m a systems-oriented engineer in Auckland — four years across gameplay, systems and
        engine-adjacent code, strongest in C++ and C#. The part I care about is why a structure is
        shaped the way it is, what it costs, and where it could be better.
      </p>
      <p>
        B.S.E from Media Design School (2023–2025). Mentored there in 2025 and at NZGDC 2024, and I
        keep turning up to Global Game Jam. Away from a compiler I’m learning Mandarin.
      </p>
      <p>
        Looking for engineering roles — Auckland or remote — where the interesting problems are
        under the hood.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step" data-step="1">
    <div class="ab__tech">
      <p class="label label--signal">Tech</p>
      <ul class="grid-cells">
        {tech.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ab__anchor {
    right: -18%;
    top: 55%;
    --aw: min(26vmin, 16rem);
  }
  .ab__text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 44rem;
  }
  .ab__text h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .ab__text p {
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .ab__tech {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }
  .ab__tech .label {
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .ab__text,
    .ab__tech {
      max-width: min(44rem, 56vw);
    }
  }
</style>
